{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n石窯烤製!招牌四重芝士蜂蜜薄餅\n</p>\n<h2>名古屋手工薄餅BBBond登港！</h2>\n<p>薄餅控注意！日本名古屋超人氣手工薄餅店 BBBond 宣布登陸香港，並將於 12月 在中環開設海外首間分店！BBBond在當地Tabelog達3.69分、更是名古屋訂位次數名列前茅的神店，首度衝出日本就選擇香港，一眾Pizza迷絕對要mark實日期！</p>\n<h2>石窯高溫烤製3款常設薄餅！</h2>\n<p>BBBond最大賣點是將日式職人級麵包工藝融入拿玻里薄餅，店家採用高含水量麵糰經過反覆揉製與長時間發酵，經石窯高溫烤製後的餅底柔軟蓬鬆、帶有細緻嚼勁，邊位更呈現圓潤微脆的口感。店家薄餅款式走極簡路線，常設薄餅以Formaggi、Marinara，以及經典Margherita為主。不過店方亦會不定期推出季節限定薄餅，令熟客每次到訪都有新鮮感。</p>\n<p>BBBond<br/>\n地址：中環SoHo雲咸街，預計12月開幕<br/>\n官方IG：@pizza_bbbond</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316725419024367_20386337836ae18f9693d94.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316725419024367_20386337836ae18f9693d94.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316725614413806_15044913646ae18f98833ab.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316725614413806_15044913646ae18f98833ab.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17931672582018737_4650138306ae18f9a9e463.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17931672582018737_4650138306ae18f9a9e463.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316726038276116_12755735236ae18f9cdcbac.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316726038276116_12755735236ae18f9cdcbac.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316726273655632_12153042926ae18f9f2cea1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316726273655632_12153042926ae18f9f2cea1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316726481547631_4748384466ae18fa137a01.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316726481547631_4748384466ae18fa137a01.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316726694354548_11270499926ae18fa3443ca.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316726694354548_11270499926ae18fa3443ca.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfBoaqsiR65/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T06:21:17.806367+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":534,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T06:01:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T07:58:40.567492+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T06:18:34.467174+00:00","content_hash":"c261e9cadb1d482f1ebc15a9af2c8347fa0aa443